  PASS: --uninstall leaves a foreign pre-push hook alone
  PASS:   and says so
  PASS: install REFUSES to overwrite a foreign pre-push hook (exit 4)
  PASS: --uninstall removes OUR stub (exit 0)
  PASS: REAL push on a branch WITH githooks/ is refused by the red gate
  PASS:   and it was the IN-TREE hook that ran (not the fallback)
  PASS: THE PIN: REAL push on a branch with NO githooks/ still runs the gate
