  PASS: XYZ_SKIP_PREPUSH=1 works on the fallback path too
  PASS:   and still announces that nothing was verified
  PASS: a delete-only push is not gated on the fallback path
  PASS: a linked worktree resolves to the SAME hooks dir as its parent clone
