  PASS: a branch with NEITHER gate refuses the push
  PASS:   and says a gate that cannot run is not one that passed
  PASS: ci.yml has the restored push: trigger
  PASS: ci.yml has the restored pull_request: trigger
  PASS: ci.yml still exists with its jobs intact
  PASS: the GH-509 Phase 4 cost reasoning is PRESERVED for re-arm
  PASS: the file states that the public-repo bridge has ended
  PASS: the macOS job still has NO workflow_dispatch of its own
  PASS: zero configured checks does NOT refuse the merge (prose fallback)
