  PASS: a NON-empty --json bucket with a failure still refuses (exit 4)
  PASS: a genuine check FAILURE still refuses the merge (exit 4)
  PASS:   and says checks are not green
  PASS:   and echoes gh's own output so the failure is visible
  PASS: passing checks proceed silently (exit 0)
  PASS:   and do NOT claim CI was absent
  PASS: empty repo path is REFUSED by mkremote (exit 2), not silently applied to $PWD
  PASS:   and the caller's real clone keeps its origin
  PASS: empty repo path is REFUSED by realpush (exit 2) — `cd ""` would push the caller's repo
  PASS: empty repo path is REFUSED by drive (exit 2)
  PASS: a REAL repo path outside $WORK is REFUSED (exit 2) — the guard is containment, not a null check
